---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CTASection from '../../components/CTASection.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <section class="section" style="padding-bottom: 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/projects" class="back-link">← Back to Projects</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 2rem;">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Corporate</span>
      <h1 class="section-title" style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3rem);">TechCorp Global HQ</h1>
      <p class="section-subtitle" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">Complete AV integration for a 12-floor corporate headquarters.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: 0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="project-hero-img" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1d24, #0d1117);">
        <span style="font-size: 5rem; opacity: 0.2;">🏢</span>
      </div>

      <div class="project-detail-grid">
        <div class="project-detail-main">
          <h2>Overview</h2>
          <p>TechCorp International engaged AVIT Solutions to design and implement a comprehensive AV system for their new 12-floor global headquarters. The project encompassed everything from executive boardrooms to a 200-seat auditorium, requiring seamless integration with their existing Microsoft Teams and Zoom infrastructure.</p>

          <h2>Scope</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>12 executive boardrooms with wireless presentation and 4K video conferencing</li>
            <li>24 huddle rooms with plug-and-play collaboration systems</li>
            <li>200-seat auditorium with immersive audio, laser projection, and live streaming</li>
            <li>Digital signage network across all floors and lobby</li>
            <li>Unified communication integration (Teams, Zoom, Webex)</li>
            <li>Centralized AV control and monitoring system</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Outcome</h2>
          <p>The system was delivered on schedule and under budget. TechCorp reported a 40% reduction in meeting setup time and significantly higher user adoption compared to their previous system. The auditorium has become a flagship space for company all-hands and client events.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="project-detail-side">
          <div class="detail-card glass">
            <h3>Project Details</h3>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>Client</span><span>TechCorp International</span></div>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>Industry</span><span>Enterprise Technology</span></div>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>Duration</span><span>6 months</span></div>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>Budget</span><span>$500K+</span></div>
            <div class="detail-row"><span>Status</span><span style="color: var(--accent);">Completed</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-card glass">
            <h3>Technologies</h3>
            <div class="tech-tags">
              <span>Crestron</span><span>Shure</span><span>Epson</span><span>Microsoft Teams</span><span>Zoom Rooms</span><span>Biamp</span><span>Samsung</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection
    title="Ready for a Corporate AV Upgrade?"
    subtitle="Let's design a system that transforms your workplace."
    ctaText="Contact Us"
    ctaLink="/contact"
  />
</Layout>

<style>
  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .back-link:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  .project-hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 400px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .project-detail-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .project-detail-main h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .project-detail-main h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }

  .project-detail-main p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .project-detail-main ul {
    list-style: none;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 2;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .project-detail-main ul li {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .project-detail-main ul li::before {
    content: '›';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .detail-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .detail-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .detail-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .detail-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .detail-row span:first-child {
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  .detail-row span:last-child {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .tech-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .tech-tags span {
    padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .project-detail-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .project-hero-img {
      height: 250px;
    }
  }
</style>
